@baseUrl = https://localhost:7284

### 1) Public: anyone can view products → expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 2) Delete WITHOUT a token → expect 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### 3) Login with a WRONG password → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "wrong" }

### 4) Login with the RIGHT password → expect 200 + token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "YOUR_REAL_PASSWORD" }

### 5) Delete WITH the token → expect 404 (auth passed; product 999 doesn't exist)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
